              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, bow and light armour. May have throwing spear (+2 pts), kontos (+3 pts), shield (+2 pts), barding (+4 pts). Light Cavalry. Nomad Cavalry. There must be at least three times as many Nomadic horse archer models in the army as there are Noble cavalry models. (Armies of Antiquity p.31)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
