            </profile>
            <profile id="2e4a-6a14-b4fd-2826" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="aab0-aa1e-0319-4ffe" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each wagon has a crew of five defenders armed with hand weapons and javelins. Any number of defenders may have bows (+2 pts). All wagons must be set up as a single group with no more than 2" between each wagon, within 6" of the Nomadic Horde player's table edge. Wagons count as a defended obstacle and provide hard cover. Defenders are skirmishers forming a single unit that must remain with the wagons unless they break or flee. 0-1 (one laager, any number of wagons: take several). (Armies of Antiquity p.31)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="50"/>
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
